          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A classic never goes out of style—and white tapered candles are proof. They’re the go-to accent for everything from formal dinners and wedding receptions to everyday living spaces that deserve a soft glow. Clean and graceful, these candles instantly elevate any table, fireplace mantel, or entryway console.</p><p>Hosting a celebration? <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles\">Unscented Taper candles</a> in white are a natural fit for floral centerpieces, candleholders, or candelabras. Their understated charm blends beautifully into any color scheme. Keep a few extra sets on hand for last-minute guests or unexpected dinner parties.</p><p>Order now and get fast, free shipping on every box.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
